## OPERATOR MASTERY LAYERS (L1-L5)

**L1 Timing:** All 15 models executable now. AI consulting has 12-24mo window before commoditization. Commodity brokering has seasonal timing (harvest cycles).

**L2 Reflexivity:** Service models (1,7,8) create positive feedback: good results → referrals → more clients → better case studies. Template/content models compound via SEO flywheel.

**L3 Network:** Micro-brokering (#3) has strongest network effects — each supplier/buyer relationship opens adjacent deals. Newsletter (#4) builds audience network. Job board (#12) has true two-sided network effect.

**L4 Cognitive:** Cash Conversion Cycle optimization:
- Best CCC: Templates (#2) = -30 days (paid before any cost)
- Service CCC: SDR (#1) = +30-45 days (work before payment)
- Brokering CCC: #3 = +60-90 days (long trade cycle). Mitigate with advance payment structure.
- Target: Negative CCC models first, use float to fund positive-CCC ventures.

**L5 Deal Structure:** Retainer > project for services. Annual > monthly for subscriptions. Prepay > net-30 for brokering. Every model should engineer payment timing advantage.

